{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 1, "text": "Mila! Não! Estás louca!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 3, "text": "Ah-ah! O QUE É ISTO?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 4, "text": "É uma nova expressão é?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 5, "text": "Vá lá, conta  mais!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 6, "text": "Ver sempre a mesma cara fica tão aborrecido!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 8, "text": "//Arena Mita \"Olá\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 9, "text": "Como está a correr, meu querido e incansável vagabundo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 10, "text": "Ainda a correr de um lado para o outro? Ainda não te cansaste o suficiente?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 12, "text": "O que fizeste à Mila?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 14, "text": "Oh, então ainda não estás cansado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 15, "text": "Perfeito! Vamos jogar outro jogo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 17, "text": "Tu..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 19, "text": "Vamos começar com um pequeno teste!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 20, "text": "Vamos testar a tua coordenação!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 21, "text": "Testar a tua capacidade de agir!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 22, "text": "E se houver algo de errado contigo!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 23, "text": "E se nem sequer mereceres essa PELE"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 24, "text": "de que tanto te orgulhas!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 25, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 26, "text": "// Mostra facas"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 27, "text": "Olha aqui..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 28, "text": "Qual delas te chama mais à atenção?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 29, "text": "A da direita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 30, "text": "Ou"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 31, "text": "a da esquerda?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 33, "text": "// Lança facas"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 34, "text": "Oh, a sério?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 35, "text": "Isso importa sequer?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 36, "text": "Só estava a brincar contigo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 37, "text": "Facadas são coisas do passado, de qualquer maneira."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 38, "text": "Seja como for!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 39, "text": "Tenho jogos muito melhores planeados,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 40, "text": "como..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 41, "text": "//  Mostra gravador"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 42, "text": "Olha aqui!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 43, "text": "Precisamos de música!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 44, "text": "O que achas desta melodia?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 45, "text": "Faz o meu sangue vibrar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 46, "text": "Vou começar"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 47, "text": "com as regras!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 48, "text": "// Mostra regras"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 49, "text": "Enquanto a música estiver a tocar,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 50, "text": "podes mexer-te."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 51, "text": "Mas quando a música parar,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 52, "text": "NÃO TE MEXAS!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 53, "text": "Ou estás morto. Entendido?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 54, "text": "É simples: chega ao fim"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 55, "text": "antes que a música acabe."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 56, "text": "Vamos começar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 57, "text": "Ainda parado aí, hein?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 58, "text": "Corre, docinho, corre!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 60, "text": "//Gravador pronto"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 61, "text": "Ah!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 62, "text": "Olha para ti! Tão obediente!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 63, "text": "Um pequeno espécime perfeito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 64, "text": "Quero-te só para mim!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 65, "text": "Mas foi demasiado fácil, não foi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 67, "text": "Deixa-me ir!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 69, "text": "Não te acomodes demasiado!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 70, "text": "Temos muitos mais jogos para jogar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 71, "text": "Aqui está o próximo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 72, "text": "Vou fechar os olhos..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 73, "text": "E quando os abrir,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 74, "text": "é melhor não estares aqui!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 75, "text": "Entendido?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 76, "text": "Se te vir, vou castigar-te!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 77, "text": "Bom! Vamos começar!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 79, "text": "Isto é inútil..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 80, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 81, "text": "// Pronto para esconder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 82, "text": "Conseguiste!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 83, "text": "Estás a sair-te bem—isto está a ficar emocionante!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 84, "text": "Mas agora vai ficar mais difícil."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 85, "text": "MUITO mais difícil."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 86, "text": "Esconde-te, corre, gira—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 88, "text": "Gah, vai para o inferno!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 90, "text": "// Jogador cai"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location20", "line_index": 91, "text": "Acho que consegui escapar..."}
